<%# ID-7: Terms (DEV_GUIDE §5, text as written). -%>
<article class="card prose">
  <p>By using Campus Notes you agree to these rules.</p>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Be kind.</strong> Disagree with ideas, not people.</li>
    <li><strong>No harassment.</strong> No insults, threats, hate speech or pile-ons.</li>
    <li><strong>No doxxing.</strong> Never post another person's name, photo, contact details or other personal information without their consent, not even anonymously.</li>
    <li><strong>No spam.</strong> No advertising, link farming or selling followers or accounts. Selling your own used things under Trade is fine.</li>
    <li><strong>Nothing illegal,</strong> and nothing you do not have the right to share.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Moderators may hide any post or comment that breaks these rules and may suspend accounts that keep breaking them. Anonymous does not mean unaccountable: moderators can see who wrote a post when they review a report.</p>
  <p>Campus Notes is a course project provided as is, without any guarantee.</p>
</article>
